---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@/components/container.astro";
import PageTitle from "@/components/PageTitle.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Us - Religious Freedom Indiana">
  <Container>
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <PageTitle title="About Us" />
      <div class="mt-2 w-full text-text">
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Religious Freedom Indiana (RFI) is dedicated to building an Indiana
          where no faith is treated as second-class. Founded in April 2025, we
          actively advocate alongside like-minded citizens across the state to
          protect genuine religious freedom for everyone.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Our organization began its work in partnership with the national group <a
            href="https://www.christiansagainstchristiannationalism.org/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-primary hover:underline"
            >Christians Against Christian Nationalism</a
          >, addressing the urgent need for a unified voice against distortions
          of faith in the public sphere. Since our founding, we've continued
          expanding our network by partnering with numerous organizations
          throughout Indiana and across the United States.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          This collaborative approach is rooted in our belief that building the
          broadest possible coalition makes us stronger, wiser, and more
          effective in achieving our mission.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          We invite you to explore our resources and join us in protecting
          religious freedom for all Hoosiers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <PageTitle title="Our Network" class="mt-12" />
      <p class="text-lg mb-4">
        Religious Freedom Indiana believes in the power of working together. By
        building a diverse network of like-minded organizations — from national
        voices to local initiatives — we strengthen our collective efforts to
        protect genuine religious freedom for all. Below are some of the allies,
        collaborators, and organizations we've connected with as we work
        together to safeguard faith, equity, and democracy in Indiana and
        beyond.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-primary">
        National Allies
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-4 italic text-gray-600">
        Coming soon — connections with national organizations supporting
        religious liberty and pluralism.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-primary">
        Statewide Collaborators
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-4 italic text-gray-600">
        Coming soon — organizations across Indiana we are building relationships
        with.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-primary">
        Local Connections
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-4 italic text-gray-600">
        Coming soon — local churches, nonprofits, and civic groups who share our
        mission.
      </p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Styles specific to this page can go here */
</style>
